					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The three biggest problems I have with this article are:</p> <p>That is very obviously not an infrared image.</p> <p>I kept reading the dialogue as that one flock of seagulls song.</p> <p>The description of the creatures made me picture battletoads.</p> <p>The other problems mostly stem from the fact that it's a boring &quot;portal to elsewhere from which strange creatures stumble, here have a log&quot; cliche type SCP written in an overcasual conversational tone that grates on me as I read. Anyway, downvoted.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
