					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-386890#post-1246468</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-386890/scp-975#post-1246468</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 31 Aug 2011 20:28:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>tombones</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>398766</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like the setup here, and the fact that the Foundation has elected to keep these critters locked up near the horse they rode in on, despite them being terrified and pleading for help. The implied threat is a little too vague to do much for me, though. Maybe that's intentional, but I hoped that whatever the 975-2 were running from would be a bit weirder, if that makes any sense.</p> <p>The whole scenario reminds me of the GRRM short story &quot;Dark, Dark Were The Tunnels&quot; which is definitely not a bad thing.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
